    "text": "By Jordan James ,\n5 hours ago NASHVILLE, Tenn. (WSMV) - Metro Nashville’s Historic Zoning Commission has ordered the reconstruction of a historic Calvin Avenue property after it was demolished without the required approvals. The nearly 100-year-old house was the former location of the popular record store known as “The Groove.”. Commissioners voted to deny... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
